      "reason": "The reference system keeps received cheques in 1211, cheques in the bank in 1212 and deposit fees in 55, all made by the cheque module, and notes payable in 216. The chart here keeps them in leaf accounts it installs (WP26): 120601 under the group 1206 for notes receivable, 120602 under the same group for funds under collection, 546 under other expenses for the deposit fees and 212001 under the group 212 for notes payable, each routed through a row the owner can change. The groups 1206 and 212 stay groups with no posting, and 216 stays the unused gift cards.",
